message: "Please cite a specific commit or verified archived release of this software."
title: "Project Vulcan: Probabilistic Decision Analysis under Aerospace Uncertainty"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Project Vulcan contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/MedeiroszJoao/Project-Vulcan"
url: "https://github.com/MedeiroszJoao/Project-Vulcan"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible research software for scenario-conditional Bayesian decision
  analysis, numerical verification, prospective public-signal scoring protocols
  and separated experimental forecast-method benchmarks. This project is not
  a calibrated aerospace safety or launch-reliability model.
keywords:
  - Bayesian decision analysis
  - value of information
  - uncertainty quantification
  - scientific computing
  - aerospace systems
license: MIT
